      {
        "heading": "Who are the biggest federal buyers and what markets do they buy from Verizon Business Network Services?",
        "body": "The Department of Defense is the largest buyer with $115M and the Department of Health and Human Services follows with $93.6M. Wired Telecommunications Carriers is the largest market with $301M, and Wireless Telecommunications Carriers (except Satellite) is the second market with $28.8M."
